  dir_message_err_string.pcpp - break step of dir_message.pcpp:
  a text that is not a plain string (a wide L"..." literal)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\dir_message_err_string.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\dir_message_err_string.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
